  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 Loan Agreement between the Commonwealth of Australia and the Independent State of Papua New Guinea for general budget support.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia and Papua New Guinea have signed a A$570&#xa0;million concessional loan agreement on 12&#xa0;December 2024 to support Papua New Guinea&#x2019;s budget and economic reforms. The general budget support enabled the Papua New Guinean Government to meet its 2024 budget financing needs, and supported the delivery of macroeconomic reform actions under Papua New Guinea&#x2019;s International Monetary Fund Extended Credit Facility and Extended Fund Facility Program.</narrative>
  </description>
